{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/451a5117046d4580370aab02f8c5a5b4.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"The Night Crawler\" width=1600 height=473 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/75d2e5416e911750761b6d1dbecc80d9.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"Discover th Enchanting world of Noctural Insects\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your terrarium awaits! Grab your flashlight and embark on a delightful journey to create a new home for tiny, fascinating creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/e04f6268527f7df161975bc568c58179.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"Collect and feed\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fill your terrarium with a variety of insects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take on the role of a caretaker, ensuring your little companions are well-fed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/9eb58fca21606cd17d46ea181d6084bf.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"Quests and Notes\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Let your quests and journal guide your progression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn coins and unlock new insects by completing missions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/878fc4e271f5cfe61a23d6ad3e9766ac.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"Upgrade Your Gear\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Purchase upgrades to make the hunt phase a breeze.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/e6d66a2568427b2fa6bb9f613a8cf7f0.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"Lot of Steam Achievements\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game has a lot of Steam achievements for you to unlock. We value your time, so every achievement is designed to be fun and attainable. No endless grinding required!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/d574108a15e3d55d0c67f7eff83b8ef4.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"Accessible Experience\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tailor the game to your preferences or abilities:<br>You can adjust the time limit and light radius of your torchlight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/b33f0343ae3d22d2d7d79fd102865ffc.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"easy and relaxing gameplay\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All you need is a mouse or trackpad. Sit back, relax, and enjoy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/5e5d9cc26369c396bc9935e598d349de.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"A tiny &amp;quot;One sitting&amp;quot; game\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you focus on the main quests and journal, you can complete the game in a single session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893470/extras/39efd144314dabd9461127baf1553100.avif?t=1759126768\" alt=\"Insects\" data-has-big width=1560 height=159 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you do in <i>The Night Crawler</i>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hunt:</strong> Click to collect insects during night hunt phases, you can only see around your mouse!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The house:</strong> Learn facts about your discoveries; manage your creatures' appetite by feeding them; complete quests and earn money to buy food and gear.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Night Crawler does not offer:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration or movement: it\u2019s a mouse only game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of gameplay: It\u2019s a tiny game, fully finishable in under an hour.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A strange discovery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893470/5fa7a7e8db0739b38e26dbedb8e170903a89f285.jpg"},{"name":"Collector expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893470/adc6fbfb4a0a8c66cadccd24aa7bcbcc5f854ecc.jpg"},{"name":"Brown Slug expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893470/45b4552edc375a371b20f35fa257449d838d0617.jpg"},{"name":"American Cockroach expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3893470/f0315740ce260ae38743944fe4f46660cc9c2823.jpg"},{"name":"Rhinoceros Beetle expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/38